<title>USA: Acquisition of NHP completed.</title>
<headline>Acquisition of NHP completed.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>NHP Inc said Friday Apartment Investment and Management Co has completed its previously announced purchase of NHP.</p>
